-- NomadCare v2 — supabase/setup_all.sql (GENERATED by tools/db-test/run.sh)
-- = every file of supabase/migrations/ in order. Do not edit: edit the
-- migrations and re-run the harness. Paste into Supabase > SQL Editor > Run,
-- then run supabase/seed.sql. Safe to run again (idempotent).
